# Everything in the repo root is served as a static file, so anything that is
# not part of the site is excluded here rather than published by accident.

*.md
docs/
.claude/
.git/
.gitignore

# The full-resolution source photos. Kept in the repo so the site's images can
# be re-cut at any size later, but nothing on the page ever requests them and
# they are ~10 MB — they have no business in a deployment.
assets/originals/

# scripts/ is NOT excluded: if you use the build-time model fetch
# (docs/mobilebert-setup.md §7 option A), Vercel needs fetch-model.sh present
# at build time. It costs a few hundred bytes of static hosting.
